WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.805
As deep generative models grow more capable,

00:00:02.885 --> 00:00:06.805
they increasingly memorize and reproduce their
training data,

00:00:06.885 --> 00:00:09.886
raising serious privacy and copyright concerns.

00:00:09.966 --> 00:00:13.493
This paper, from Layer 6 AI and published at ICLR 2025,

00:00:13.573 --> 00:00:19.197
proposes the manifold memorization hypothesis: a
geometric framework that reasons about

00:00:19.277 --> 00:00:24.639
memorization through the local intrinsic dimension
of the data and model manifolds.

00:00:24.719 --> 00:00:28.770
It provides a formal standard for how memorized a
datapoint is,

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:35.130
cleanly separates memorization caused by
overfitting from memorization caused by the data itself,

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:41.490
and yields scalable tools to detect and mitigate
memorization all the way up to Stable Diffusion.
